        },
        {
            "verse": 2,
            "text": [
                "> Waayo, naxariistiisu waa weyn tahay,",
                "> Daacadnimada Eebbe waxay sii jiraysaa weligeed.",
                "---",
                "> Sharafta Eebbe!"
            ]
        }
    ]
